          "settings": {
            "heading": "Material",
            "description": "<p>House of Even jewellery is crafted using <strong>18K</strong> and <strong>14K gold PVD-plated stainless steel,</strong> solid <strong>sterling silver (S925)</strong>, and <strong>sterling silver finished with 24K gold plating.</strong> </p><p>Our <strong>stainless steel</strong> pieces are made with advanced technology for enhanced durability, offering a <strong>waterproof, tarnish-resistant </strong>finish designed for everyday wear. </p><p><strong>Sterling silver</strong> pieces are timeless by nature and may develop a soft patina over time, which can be easily polished to restore shine.</p>",
