      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What materials are used in your jewellery?",
            "description": "<p><br/><strong>Materials & Finishes</strong></p><p>At House of Even, we work with carefully selected materials to ensure durability, comfort, and timeless beauty.</p><p>Our collections feature <strong>18K gold plated stainless steel using advanced PVD (Physical Vapour Deposition) technology</strong>, as well as <strong>14K gold plated PVD</strong>, <strong>sterling silver S925</strong>, and <strong>sterling silver finished with 24K gold plating</strong>.</p><p>PVD plating is a high-performance process that bonds gold to the metal at a molecular level, creating a finish that is significantly more durable than standard fashion plating. The result is jewellery that is <strong>waterproof, tarnish-resistant, and designed for everyday wear</strong>.</p><p>Many of our designs are finished with <strong>natural freshwater pearls, hand-selected crystals, and semi-precious gemstones</strong>, making each piece subtly unique.</p><p><strong>Hypoallergenic & Skin-Friendly</strong><br/><br/>Yes. All House of Even jewellery is <strong>nickel-free and lead-free</strong>, making it suitable for sensitive skin and comfortable for daily wear.</p><p><strong>Waterproof Jewellery</strong><br/><br/>Our PVD-coated and sterling silver pieces are designed to be worn in the shower, at the gym, or by the sea. To help preserve their finish over time, we recommend rinsing your jewellery with fresh water after swimming in salt or chlorinated water.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is your return policy",
            "description": "<p>We accept returns within 14 days of delivery for jewellery that is unworn, in original condition, and in original packaging. For hygiene reasons, earrings are not eligible for return.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "IS YOUR JEWELLERY HYPOALLERGENIC?",
            "description": "<p>Yes. Our jewellery is 100% nickel and lead-free, making it safe for sensitive skin and comfortable for daily wear.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I wear my jewellery in water?",
            "description": "<p>Our PVD-coated pieces (18K and 14K gold PVD) are waterproof and tarnish-resistant, making them suitable for everyday wear — including showers, workouts, and swimming.</p><p>Sterling silver (S925 and 24K gold-plated sterling silver) is water-resistant but more delicate. We recommend removing these pieces before prolonged water exposure to maintain their finish and prevent natural oxidation.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "disabled": true,
